		<div id="question-140-answer" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
			<div class="accordion-body">
				<div class="accordion-text redesign-text fr-view"><p data-pasted="true">Your next water/sewer invoice should mail before the dates shown below. &nbsp;</p><p>If you have any questions call 781-231-4139 and 781-231-4135 or email <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#a3cec6d7c6d1d7c6c0cbe3d0c2d6c4d6d08ecec28dc4ccd5"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="c2afa7b6a7b0b6a7a1aa82b1a3b7a5b7b1efafa3eca5adb4">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> or <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#5a2e283f3b292f283f281a293b2f3d2f2977373b743d352c"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="d2a6a0b7b3a1a7a0b7a092a1b3a7b5a7a1ffbfb3fcb5bda4">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p><table style="width: 100%; margin: auto; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; height: 155px;"><colgroup><col style="width: 33.3333%;"><col style="width: 33.3333%;"><col style="width: 33.3333%;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><strong style='box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;' data-pasted="true">Water/Sewer - Utility Bills</strong><br></td><td><strong>Semi-Annual Invoices</strong><strong>​</strong><br></td><td><strong>Quarterly Invoices</strong><br></td></tr><tr style="height: 33px;"><td><strong style='box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(235, 235, 235); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;' data-pasted="true">Bill Period</strong><br></td><td>&nbsp;<strong>Bill Date</strong><br></td><td><strong>Due Date</strong><br></td></tr><tr style="height: 56px;"><td>August &nbsp;- February</td><td>Usually in May<br></td><td>30 Days after bill date - if falls on a weekend - next business day<br></td></tr><tr><td>February - August</td><td>Usually October<br></td><td>30 Days after bill date - if falls on a weekend - next business day<br></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p></div>
