		<div id="question-126-answer" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
			<div class="accordion-body">
				<div class="accordion-text redesign-text fr-view"><h2 class="subhead1">Effective December 13, 2005 Parking Violations are as follows:</h2><table border="1" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="1" style="float: left;" class="fr-alternate-rows"><thead><tr><th>Violation</th><th>Fee</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Meter Violation</td><td>$25</td></tr><tr><td>Within 10 Feet of Hydrant</td><td>$100</td></tr><tr><td>Feeding Meter</td><td>$25</td></tr><tr><td>Blocking Free Flow of Traffic</td><td>$25</td></tr><tr><td>Overtime Parking</td><td>$25</td></tr><tr><td>Double Parking</td><td>$25</td></tr><tr><td>Not Parking Within Marked space</td><td>$25</td></tr><tr><td>Not Parking Within Fire/Breakdown Lane</td><td>$50</td></tr><tr><td>Over 12 Inches from Curb</td><td>$25</td></tr><tr><td>Impeding Street Cleaning or Snow Removal</td><td>$100</td></tr><tr><td>Wrong Direction Parking</td><td>$25</td></tr><tr><td>Resident/Permit Parking Only</td><td>$25</td></tr><tr><td>Parking Over 48 Hrs.</td><td>$25</td></tr><tr><td>Snow Emergency</td><td>$100</td></tr><tr><td>Restricted Area</td><td>$25</td></tr><tr><td>Crosswalk</td><td>$50</td></tr><tr><td>Driveway / Private Way Blocking</td><td>$25</td></tr><tr><td>Sidewalk</td><td>$50</td></tr><tr><td>Impeding Handicap Van/Ramp</td><td>$300</td></tr><tr><td>Within 20 Feet of an Intersection</td><td>$25</td></tr><tr><td>HP / DV Parking</td><td>$300</td></tr><tr><td>Bus Stop</td><td>$25</td></tr><tr><td>Parking Taxi Stand</td><td>$25</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
				<span class="badge text-body category-pill rounded-pill mw-100 text-truncate">Treasurer / Collector</span>
